    {
      "id": "mail_access_permissions",
      "type": "values",
      "description": "Application permissions that read, send or impersonate mail organisation-wide (Microsoft Graph and Exchange Online: mail, mailbox items and folders, import / export and migration, Exchange Web Services). The mailbox-access and mailbox-impersonation reports look for these and name the ones a service principal holds. EWS.AccessAsUser.All is delegated only -- kept so a grant that shows it is never missed.",
